  "details": "\n---\n_-= Per source details. Do not edit below this line.=-_\n\n## Source: kam193 (080884e1b90e6717f2e13d434608203eb24db65a5071803022d3d12b6a7032d5)\nDuring installation or import, package executes an embedded malicious executable acting as an infostealer.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-11-instantscrape\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - infostealer\n\n\n - The package overrides the install command in setup.py to execute malicious code during installation.\n\n\n - files-exfiltration\n\n\n - obfuscation\n",
